{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016tx4jvfokJ1r85k6fENRQP","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→use std::collections::BTreeMap;\n     2→\n     3→use tank_core::{\n     4→    FilterState, MicrobeState, PlantGuild, PlantGuildState, ProcessParams, ShrimpRuntimeParams,\n     5→    SimMeta, SimSeed, SourceWaterProfile, SubstrateLayerState, TankGeometry, TankState, WaterState,\n     6→};\n     7→use tank_data::{load_scenario, ScenarioPreset};\n     8→\n     9→#[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq)]\n    10→pub struct ScenarioGeometryOverrides {\n    11→    pub size_scale: f64,\n    12→    pub fill_ratio: f64,\n    13→}\n    14→\n    15→impl Default for ScenarioGeometryOverrides {\n    16→    fn default() -> Self {\n    17→        Self {\n    18→            size_scale: 1.0,\n    19→            fill_ratio: 1.0,\n    20→        }\n    21→    }\n    22→}\n    23→\n    24→pub fn default_scenario_ids() -> &'static [&'static str] {\n    25→    tank_data::scenario_ids()\n    26→}\n    27→\n    28→pub fn load_named_scenario(id: &str) -> Result<ScenarioPreset, tank_data::PresetError> {\n    29→    load_scenario(id)\n    30→}\n    31→\n    32→pub fn seeded_state_with_overrides(\n    33→    seed: SimSeed,\n    34→    scenario_id: &str,\n    35→    overrides: ScenarioGeometryOverrides,\n    36→) -> Result<TankState, tank_data::PresetError> {\n    37→    validate_geometry_overrides(scenario_id, overrides)?;\n    38→    let mut scenario = load_named_scenario(scenario_id)?;\n    39→    scenario.tank_length_cm *= overrides.size_scale;\n    40→    scenario.tank_width_cm *= overrides.size_scale;\n    41→    scenario.tank_height_cm *= overrides.size_scale;\n    42→    scenario.fill_height_cm =\n    43→        (scenario.fill_height_cm * overrides.size_scale * overrides.fill_ratio)\n    44→            .min(scenario.tank_height_cm);\n    45→\n    46→    materialize_scenario(seed, scenario)\n    47→}\n    48→\n    49→/// Converts a `tank_data::SourceWaterPreset` into a `tank_core::SourceWaterProfile`.\n    50→fn source_water_to_profile(preset: &tank_data::SourceWaterPreset) -> SourceWaterProfile {\n    51→    SourceWaterProfile {\n    52→        temperature_c: preset.temperature_c,\n    53→        ammonia_mg_n_per_l: preset.ammonia_mg_n_per_l,\n    54→        nitrite_mg_n_per_l: preset.nitrite_mg_n_per_l,\n    55→        nitrate_mg_n_per_l: preset.nitrate_mg_n_per_l,\n    56→        phosphate_mg_p_per_l: preset.phosphate_mg_p_per_l,\n    57→        dic_mg_c_per_l: preset.dic_mg_c_per_l,\n    58→        doc_mg_c_per_l: preset.doc_mg_c_per_l,\n    59→        don_mg_n_per_l: preset.don_mg_n_per_l,\n    60→        alkalinity_meq_per_l: preset.alkalinity_meq_per_l,\n    61→        calcium_mg_per_l: preset.calcium_mg_per_l,\n    62→        magnesium_mg_per_l: preset.magnesium_mg_per_l,\n    63→        sodium_mg_per_l: preset.sodium_mg_per_l,\n    64→        potassium_mg_per_l: preset.potassium_mg_per_l,\n    65→        bicarbonate_mg_per_l: preset.bicarbonate_mg_per_l,\n    66→        chloride_mg_per_l: preset.chloride_mg_per_l,\n    67→        sulfate_mg_per_l: preset.sulfate_mg_per_l,\n    68→    }\n    69→}\n    70→\n    71→/// Converts a `tank_data::ProcessParamsPreset` into `tank_core::ProcessParams`.\n    72→fn process_preset_to_params(preset: &tank_data::ProcessParamsPreset) -> ProcessParams {\n    73→    ProcessParams {\n    74→        mineralization_rate_per_day: preset.mineralization_rate_per_day,\n    75→        nitrification_vmax: preset.nitrification_vmax,\n    76→        reaeration_kla_base: preset.reaeration_kla_base,\n    77→        aeration_kla_boost: preset.aeration_kla_boost,\n    78→        background_bod_mg_o2_per_g_biomass_per_hour: preset\n    79→            .background_bod_mg_o2_per_g_biomass_per_hour,\n    80→        plant_photosynthesis_o2_mg_per_g_per_hour: preset.plant_photosynthesis_o2_mg_per_g_per_hour,\n    81→        respiration_dic_rate_mg_c_per_g_per_hour: preset.respiration_dic_rate_mg_c_per_g_per_hour,\n    82→        photosynthesis_dic_rate_mg_c_per_g_per_hour: preset\n    83→            .photosynthesis_dic_rate_mg_c_per_g_per_hour,\n    84→        k_surface_w_per_m2_k: preset.k_surface_w_per_m2_k,\n    85→        k_wall_w_per_m2_k: preset.k_wall_w_per_m2_k,\n    86→\n    87→        feed_leach_rate_per_hour: preset.feed_leach_rate_per_hour,\n    88→        fine_detritus_dissolution_rate_per_hour: preset.fine_detritus_dissolution_rate_per_hour,\n    89→        feed_n_to_c_ratio: preset.feed_n_to_c_ratio,\n    90→\n    91→        decomposer_vmax_per_hour: preset.decomposer_vmax_per_hour,\n    92→        decomposer_k_doc_mg: preset.decomposer_k_doc_mg,\n    93→        decomposer_growth_yield: preset.decomposer_growth_yield,\n    94→        decomposer_decay_rate_per_hour: preset.decomposer_decay_rate_per_hour,\n    95→\n    96→        aob_vmax_mg_n_per_g_per_hour: preset.aob_vmax_mg_n_per_g_per_hour,\n    97→        aob_k_tan_mg: preset.aob_k_tan_mg,\n    98→        aob_k_do_mg: preset.aob_k_do_mg,\n    99→        aob_growth_yield: preset.aob_growth_yield,\n   100→        aob_decay_rate_per_hour: preset.aob_decay_rate_per_hour,\n   101→\n   102→        nob_vmax_mg_n_per_g_per_hour: preset.nob_vmax_mg_n_per_g_per_hour,\n   103→        nob_k_nitrite_mg: preset.nob_k_nitrite_mg,\n   104→        nob_k_do_mg: preset.nob_k_do_mg,\n   105→        nob_growth_yield: preset.nob_growth_yield,\n   106→        nob_decay_rate_per_hour: preset.nob_decay_rate_per_hour,\n   107→\n   108→        comammox_vmax_fraction: preset.comammox_vmax_fraction,\n   109→        comammox_k_tan_mg: preset.comammox_k_tan_mg,\n   110→        comammox_k_do_mg: preset.comammox_k_do_mg,\n   111→        comammox_growth_yield: preset.comammox_growth_yield,\n   112→        comammox_decay_rate_per_hour: preset.comammox_decay_rate_per_hour,\n   113→\n   114→        o2_per_mg_n_nitrified: preset.o2_per_mg_n_nitrified,\n   115→        alkalinity_meq_per_mg_n_nitrified: preset.alkalinity_meq_per_mg_n_nitrified,\n   116→\n   117→        plant_max_growth_rate_fast_stem_per_day: preset.plant_max_growth_rate_fast_stem_per_day,\n   118→        plant_max_growth_rate_root_rosette_per_day: preset\n   119→            .plant_max_growth_rate_root_rosette_per_day,\n   120→        plant_respiration_fraction_per_day: preset.plant_respiration_fraction_per_day,\n   121→        plant_senescence_fraction_per_day: preset.plant_senescence_fraction_per_day,\n   122→        plant_health_recovery_per_day: preset.plant_health_recovery_per_day,\n   123→        plant_health_decline_per_day: preset.plant_health_decline_per_day,\n   124→        plant_half_saturation_n_mg_total: preset.plant_half_saturation_n_mg_total,\n   125→        plant_half_saturation_p_mg_total: preset.plant_half_saturation_p_mg_total,\n   126→        plant_half_saturation_c_mg_total: preset.plant_half_saturation_c_mg_total,\n   127→        plant_light_half_saturation: preset.plant_light_half_saturation,\n   128→        plant_temp_optimum_c: preset.plant_temp_optimum_c,\n   129→        plant_temp_sigma_c: preset.plant_temp_sigma_c,\n   130→        plant_crowding_biomass_g_per_m2: preset.plant_crowding_biomass_g_per_m2,\n   131→\n   132→        algae_max_growth_rate_per_day: preset.algae_max_growth_rate_per_day,\n   133→        periphyton_max_growth_rate_per_day: preset.periphyton_max_growth_rate_per_day,\n   134→        algae_respiration_fraction_per_day: preset.algae_respiration_fraction_per_day,\n   135→        algae_half_saturation_n_mg_total: preset.algae_half_saturation_n_mg_total,\n   136→        algae_half_saturation_p_mg_total: preset.algae_half_saturation_p_mg_total,\n   137→        algae_light_half_saturation: preset.algae_light_half_saturation,\n   138→        algae_temp_optimum_c: preset.algae_temp_optimum_c,\n   139→        algae_temp_sigma_c: preset.algae_temp_sigma_c,\n   140→        periphyton_capacity_g_per_m2: preset.periphyton_capacity_g_per_m2,\n   141→        algae_bloom_threshold_g_per_l: preset.algae_bloom_threshold_g_per_l,\n   142→        algae_nuisance_biomass_g_per_m2: preset.algae_nuisance_biomass_g_per_m2,\n   143→\n   144→        shrimp_base_mortality_per_day: preset.shrimp_base_mortality_per_day,\n   145→        shrimp_stress_mortality_scale: preset.shrimp_stress_mortality_scale,\n   146→        shrimp_juvenile_maturation_days: preset.shrimp_juvenile_maturation_days,\n   147→        shrimp_periphyton_grazing_g_per_shrimp_per_day: preset\n   148→            .shrimp_periphyton_grazing_g_per_shrimp_per_day,\n   149→        shrimp_condition_smoothing: preset.shrimp_condition_smoothing,\n   150→\n   151→        microfauna_mineralization_boost: preset.microfauna_mineralization_boost,\n   152→        microfauna_periphyton_consumption: preset.microfauna_periphyton_consumption,\n   153→        microfauna_population_smoothing: preset.microfauna_population_smoothing,\n   154→        microfauna_shrimp_pressure_threshold: preset.microfauna_shrimp_pressure_threshold,\n   155→    }\n   156→}\n   157→\n   158→/// Materializes a scenario preset into a fully resolved `TankState`.\n   159→///\n   160→/// - Geometry comes from the scenario.\n   161→/// - `environment.ambient_temp_c` comes from the scenario.\n   162→/// - Initial `WaterState` totals come from the source-water profile × fill volume.\n   163→/// - Substrate layers come from the scenario's substrate preset IDs.\n   164→/// - Plant guilds come from the scenario's plant preset IDs.\n   165→/// - Source-water catalog is populated with all known source-water presets.\n   166→/// - Process parameters come from the scenario's process params preset.\n   167→pub fn seeded_state(seed: SimSeed, scenario_id: &str) -> Result<TankState, tank_data::PresetError> {\n   168→    let scenario = load_named_scenario(scenario_id)?;\n   169→    materialize_scenario(seed, scenario)\n   170→}\n   171→\n   172→fn materialize_scenario(\n   173→    seed: SimSeed,\n   174→    scenario: ScenarioPreset,\n   175→) -> Result<TankState, tank_data::PresetError> {\n   176→    // Geometry\n   177→    let geometry = TankGeometry {\n   178→        length_cm: scenario.tank_length_cm,\n   179→        width_cm: scenario.tank_width_cm,\n   180→        height_cm: scenario.tank_height_cm,\n   181→        fill_height_cm: scenario.fill_height_cm,\n   182→        glass_thickness_mm: 5.0,\n   183→        open_top: true,\n   184→        lid_exchange_factor: 0.25,\n   185→    };\n   186→\n   187→    // Source water profile for initial fill\n   188→    let source_water_preset = tank_data::load_source_water(&scenario.source_water_id)?;\n   189→    let source_profile = source_water_to_profile(&source_water_preset);\n   190→\n   191→    // Initial water state from source-water profile\n   192→    let water = WaterState::from_source_profile(&source_profile, &geometry);\n   193→\n   194→    // Build source-water catalog with all known presets\n   195→    let mut source_water_catalog = BTreeMap::new();\n   196→    for sw_id in tank_data::source_water_ids() {\n   197→        let sw_preset = tank_data::load_source_water(sw_id)?;\n   198→        source_water_catalog.insert(sw_id.to_string(), source_water_to_profile(&sw_preset));\n   199→    }\n   200→\n   201→    // Process parameters\n   202→    let process_preset = tank_data::load_process_params(&scenario.process_params_id)?;\n   203→    let process_params = process_preset_to_params(&process_preset);\n   204→\n   205→    // Substrate layers\n   206→    let mut substrate_layers = Vec::new();\n   207→    for sub_id in &scenario.substrate_ids {\n   208→        let sub_preset = tank_data::load_substrate(sub_id)?;\n   209→        let footprint = geometry.footprint_area_cm2();\n   210→        substrate_layers.push(SubstrateLayerState {\n   211→            kind: match sub_preset.id.as_str() {\n   212→                \"inert_sand\" => tank_core::SubstrateKind::InertSand,\n   213→                \"inert_gravel\" => tank_core::SubstrateKind::InertGravel,\n   214→                \"active_planted\" => tank_core::SubstrateKind::ActivePlanted,\n   215→                \"coarse_porous\" => tank_core::SubstrateKind::CoarsePorous,\n   216→                other => {\n   217→                    return Err(tank_data::PresetError::Validation {\n   218→                        category: \"substrate\",\n   219→                        id: other.to_string(),\n   220→                        message: format!(\"unsupported substrate kind: `{other}`\"),\n   221→                    });\n   222→                }\n   223→            },\n   224→            depth_cm: sub_preset.depth_cm,\n   225→            nutrient_store_mg_n_total: sub_preset.nutrient_charge_mg_n_total,\n   226→            nutrient_store_mg_p_total: sub_preset.nutrient_charge_mg_p_total,\n   227→            cation_exchange_capacity_index: sub_preset.cation_exchange_capacity_index,\n   228→            detritus_trapping_index: sub_preset.detritus_trapping_index,\n   229→            colonizable_area_cm2: footprint * sub_preset.colonizable_area_factor,\n   230→            low_oxygen_tendency_index: sub_preset.low_oxygen_tendency_index,\n   231→            grazing_surface_index: sub_preset.grazing_surface_index,\n   232→        });\n   233→    }\n   234→    if substrate_layers.is_empty() {\n   235→        substrate_layers.push(SubstrateLayerState::default());\n   236→    }\n   237→\n   238→    // Plant guilds\n   239→    let mut plant_guilds = Vec::new();\n   240→    for plant_id in &scenario.plant_ids {\n   241→        let plant_preset = tank_data::load_plant(plant_id)?;\n   242→        let guild = match plant_preset.guild.as_str() {\n   243→            \"FastStem\" => PlantGuild::FastStem,\n   244→            \"RootFeedingRosette\" => PlantGuild::RootFeedingRosette,\n   245→            other => {\n   246→                return Err(tank_data::PresetError::Validation {\n   247→                    category: \"plants\",\n   248→                    id: plant_id.clone(),\n   249→                    message: format!(\"unsupported plant guild: `{other}`\"),\n   250→                });\n   251→            }\n   252→        };\n   253→        plant_guilds.push(PlantGuildState {\n   254→            guild,\n   255→            biomass_g: 5.0,\n   256→            health_index: 0.8,\n   257→            crowding_index: 0.1,\n   258→            habitat_index: if guild == PlantGuild::RootFeedingRosette {\n   259→                // Habitat factor depends on substrate quality\n   260→                substrate_layers\n   261→                    .iter()\n   262→                    .map(|l| l.cation_exchange_capacity_index)\n   263→                    .fold(0.0_f64, f64::max)\n   264→                    .max(0.3)\n   265→            } else {\n   266→                0.8\n   267→            },\n   268→        });\n   269→    }\n   270→    if plant_guilds.is_empty() {\n   271→        plant_guilds.push(PlantGuildState::default());\n   272→    }\n   273→\n   274→    // Shrimp species parameters\n   275→    let shrimp_preset = tank_data::load_shrimp(&scenario.shrimp_profile_id)?;\n   276→    let shrimp_params = ShrimpRuntimeParams {\n   277→        optimal_temp_min_c: shrimp_preset.optimal_temp_min_c,\n   278→        optimal_temp_max_c: shrimp_preset.optimal_temp_max_c,\n   279→        gh_min_d: shrimp_preset.gh_min_d,\n   280→        gh_max_d: shrimp_preset.gh_max_d,\n   281→        base_spawn_rate: shrimp_preset.base_spawn_rate,\n   282→        egg_duration_days: shrimp_preset.egg_duration_days,\n   283→        hatch_success_base: shrimp_preset.hatch_success_base,\n   284→        juvenile_sensitivity: shrimp_preset.juvenile_sensitivity,\n   285→        high_temp_repro_penalty_start_c: shrimp_preset.high_temp_repro_penalty_start_c,\n   286→        high_temp_repro_penalty_full_c: shrimp_preset.high_temp_repro_penalty_full_c,\n   287→    };\n   288→\n   289→    // Environment\n   290→    let environment = tank_core::EnvironmentState {\n   291→        ambient_temp_c: scenario.ambient_temp_c,\n   292→        ..Default::default()\n   293→    };\n   294→\n   295→    let mut state = TankState::new(seed);\n   296→    state.meta = SimMeta {\n   297→        scenario_id: Some(scenario.id),\n   298→        notes: Some(scenario.name),\n   299→    };\n   300→    state.geometry = geometry;\n   301→    state.environment = environment;\n   302→    state.water = water;\n   303→    state.substrate_layers = substrate_layers;\n   304→    state.plant_guilds = plant_guilds;\n   305→    state.source_water_catalog = source_water_catalog;\n   306→    state.process_params = process_params;\n   307→    state.shrimp_params = shrimp_params;\n   308→\n   309→    Ok(state)\n   310→}\n   311→\n   312→fn validate_geometry_overrides(\n   313→    scenario_id: &str,\n   314→    overrides: ScenarioGeometryOverrides,\n   315→) -> Result<(), tank_data::PresetError> {\n   316→    if !overrides.size_scale.is_finite() || overrides.size_scale <= 0.0 {\n   317→        return Err(tank_data::PresetError::Validation {\n   318→            category: \"scenarios\",\n   319→            id: scenario_id.to_string(),\n   320→            message: format!(\n   321→                \"size_scale must be finite and > 0.0, got {}\",\n   322→                overrides.size_scale\n   323→            ),\n   324→        });\n   325→    }\n   326→\n   327→    if !overrides.fill_ratio.is_finite() || !(0.1..=1.0).contains(&overrides.fill_ratio) {\n   328→        return Err(tank_data::PresetError::Validation {\n   329→            category: \"scenarios\",\n   330→            id: scenario_id.to_string(),\n   331→            message: format!(\n   332→                \"fill_ratio must be finite and in 0.1..=1.0, got {}\",\n   333→                overrides.fill_ratio\n   334→            ),\n   335→        });\n   336→    }\n   337→\n   338→    Ok(())\n   339→}\n   340→\n   341→/// Creates a deterministic cycling fixture pair: one seeded, one unseeded.\n   342→/// Both tanks are otherwise identical (~20L nano tank with moderate source water,\n   343→/// fed daily, with aeration enabled).\n   344→/// The seeded tank starts with elevated nitrifier biomass and higher maturity;\n   345→/// the unseeded tank starts with minimal microbes and low maturity.\n   346→pub fn cycling_fixture_pair(seed: SimSeed) -> (TankState, TankState) {\n   347→    let base = cycling_base_state(seed);\n   348→\n   349→    let mut seeded = base.clone();\n   350→    seeded.meta.scenario_id = Some(\"cycling_seeded\".to_string());\n   351→    // Seeded: same decomposer biomass but much higher nitrifier biomass + maturity\n   352→    seeded.microbe = MicrobeState {\n   353→        decomposer_biomass_g: 0.1,\n   354→        ammonia_oxidizer_biomass_g: 0.20,\n   355→        nitrite_oxidizer_biomass_g: 0.15,\n   356→        comammox_biomass_g: 0.05,\n   357→        maturity_index: 0.6,\n   358→    };\n   359→    seeded.filter_state = FilterState {\n   360→        biofilter_maturity_index: 0.6,\n   361→        clogging_index: 0.0,\n   362→        seeded_biomass_index: 0.8,\n   363→    };\n   364→\n   365→    let mut unseeded = base;\n   366→    unseeded.meta.scenario_id = Some(\"cycling_unseeded\".to_string());\n   367→    // Unseeded: same decomposer biomass but minimal nitrifier biomass + maturity\n   368→    unseeded.microbe = MicrobeState {\n   369→        decomposer_biomass_g: 0.1,\n   370→        ammonia_oxidizer_biomass_g: 0.005,\n   371→        nitrite_oxidizer_biomass_g: 0.005,\n   372→        comammox_biomass_g: 0.001,\n   373→        maturity_index: 0.05,\n   374→    };\n   375→    unseeded.filter_state = FilterState {\n   376→        biofilter_maturity_index: 0.05,\n   377→        clogging_index: 0.0,\n   378→        seeded_biomass_index: 0.0,\n   379→    };\n   380→\n   381→    (seeded, unseeded)\n   382→}\n   383→\n   384→/// Base state shared by both cycling fixtures.\n   385→fn cycling_base_state(seed: SimSeed) -> TankState {\n   386→    let geometry = TankGeometry {\n   387→        length_cm: 30.0,\n   388→        width_cm: 25.0,\n   389→        height_cm: 30.0,\n   390→        fill_height_cm: 26.0,\n   391→        glass_thickness_mm: 5.0,\n   392→        open_top: true,\n   393→        lid_exchange_factor: 0.25,\n   394→    };\n   395→\n   396→    let water = WaterState::default_for_geometry(&geometry);\n   397→\n   398→    let mut state = TankState::new(seed);\n   399→    state.geometry = geometry;\n   400→    state.water = water;\n   401→    state.water.temperature_c = 25.0;\n   402→    state.environment.ambient_temp_c = 25.0;\n   403→\n   404→    // Enable moderate aeration\n   405→    state.hardware.aeration.enabled = true;\n   406→    state.hardware.aeration.intensity = 0.3;\n   407→\n   408→    // Single fast-stem plant\n   409→    state.plant_guilds = vec![PlantGuildState {\n   410→        guild: PlantGuild::FastStem,\n   411→        biomass_g: 3.0,\n   412→        health_index: 0.8,\n   413→        crowding_index: 0.1,\n   414→        habitat_index: 0.8,\n   415→    }];\n   416→\n   417→    state.process_params = ProcessParams::default();\n   418→\n   419→    state\n   420→}\n   421→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"52ade16c-d21b-4a80-87c4-793dd732d7a8","uuid":"33bdb3a0-6654-4cc5-8ece-660da076d544","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/root/tank-simulation/crates/tank_scenarios/src/lib.rs","content":"use std::collections::BTreeMap;\n\nuse tank_core::{\n    FilterState, MicrobeState, PlantGuild, PlantGuildState, ProcessParams, ShrimpRuntimeParams,\n    SimMeta, SimSeed, SourceWaterProfile, SubstrateLayerState, TankGeometry, TankState, WaterState,\n};\nuse tank_data::{load_scenario, ScenarioPreset};\n\n#[derive(Debug, Clone, Copy, PartialEq)]\npub struct ScenarioGeometryOverrides {\n    pub size_scale: f64,\n    pub fill_ratio: f64,\n}\n\nimpl Default for ScenarioGeometryOverrides {\n    fn default() -> Self {\n        Self {\n            size_scale: 1.0,\n            fill_ratio: 1.0,\n        }\n    }\n}\n\npub fn default_scenario_ids() -> &'static [&'static str] {\n    tank_data::scenario_ids()\n}\n\npub fn load_named_scenario(id: &str) -> Result<ScenarioPreset, tank_data::PresetError> {\n    load_scenario(id)\n}\n\npub fn seeded_state_with_overrides(\n    seed: SimSeed,\n    scenario_id: &str,\n    overrides: ScenarioGeometryOverrides,\n) -> Result<TankState, tank_data::PresetError> {\n    validate_geometry_overrides(scenario_id, overrides)?;\n    let mut scenario = load_named_scenario(scenario_id)?;\n    scenario.tank_length_cm *= overrides.size_scale;\n    scenario.tank_width_cm *= overrides.size_scale;\n    scenario.tank_height_cm *= overrides.size_scale;\n    scenario.fill_height_cm =\n        (scenario.fill_height_cm * overrides.size_scale * overrides.fill_ratio)\n            .min(scenario.tank_height_cm);\n\n    materialize_scenario(seed, scenario)\n}\n\n/// Converts a `tank_data::SourceWaterPreset` into a `tank_core::SourceWaterProfile`.\nfn source_water_to_profile(preset: &tank_data::SourceWaterPreset) -> SourceWaterProfile {\n    SourceWaterProfile {\n        temperature_c: preset.temperature_c,\n        ammonia_mg_n_per_l: preset.ammonia_mg_n_per_l,\n        nitrite_mg_n_per_l: preset.nitrite_mg_n_per_l,\n        nitrate_mg_n_per_l: preset.nitrate_mg_n_per_l,\n        phosphate_mg_p_per_l: preset.phosphate_mg_p_per_l,\n        dic_mg_c_per_l: preset.dic_mg_c_per_l,\n        doc_mg_c_per_l: preset.doc_mg_c_per_l,\n        don_mg_n_per_l: preset.don_mg_n_per_l,\n        alkalinity_meq_per_l: preset.alkalinity_meq_per_l,\n        calcium_mg_per_l: preset.calcium_mg_per_l,\n        magnesium_mg_per_l: preset.magnesium_mg_per_l,\n        sodium_mg_per_l: preset.sodium_mg_per_l,\n        potassium_mg_per_l: preset.potassium_mg_per_l,\n        bicarbonate_mg_per_l: preset.bicarbonate_mg_per_l,\n        chloride_mg_per_l: preset.chloride_mg_per_l,\n        sulfate_mg_per_l: preset.sulfate_mg_per_l,\n    }\n}\n\n/// Converts a `tank_data::ProcessParamsPreset` into `tank_core::ProcessParams`.\nfn process_preset_to_params(preset: &tank_data::ProcessParamsPreset) -> ProcessParams {\n    ProcessParams {\n        mineralization_rate_per_day: preset.mineralization_rate_per_day,\n        nitrification_vmax: preset.nitrification_vmax,\n        reaeration_kla_base: preset.reaeration_kla_base,\n        aeration_kla_boost: preset.aeration_kla_boost,\n        background_bod_mg_o2_per_g_biomass_per_hour: preset\n            .background_bod_mg_o2_per_g_biomass_per_hour,\n        plant_photosynthesis_o2_mg_per_g_per_hour: preset.plant_photosynthesis_o2_mg_per_g_per_hour,\n        respiration_dic_rate_mg_c_per_g_per_hour: preset.respiration_dic_rate_mg_c_per_g_per_hour,\n        photosynthesis_dic_rate_mg_c_per_g_per_hour: preset\n            .photosynthesis_dic_rate_mg_c_per_g_per_hour,\n        k_surface_w_per_m2_k: preset.k_surface_w_per_m2_k,\n        k_wall_w_per_m2_k: preset.k_wall_w_per_m2_k,\n\n        feed_leach_rate_per_hour: preset.feed_leach_rate_per_hour,\n        fine_detritus_dissolution_rate_per_hour: preset.fine_detritus_dissolution_rate_per_hour,\n        feed_n_to_c_ratio: preset.feed_n_to_c_ratio,\n\n        decomposer_vmax_per_hour: preset.decomposer_vmax_per_hour,\n        decomposer_k_doc_mg: preset.decomposer_k_doc_mg,\n        decomposer_growth_yield: preset.decomposer_growth_yield,\n        decomposer_decay_rate_per_hour: preset.decomposer_decay_rate_per_hour,\n\n        aob_vmax_mg_n_per_g_per_hour: preset.aob_vmax_mg_n_per_g_per_hour,\n        aob_k_tan_mg: preset.aob_k_tan_mg,\n        aob_k_do_mg: preset.aob_k_do_mg,\n        aob_growth_yield: preset.aob_growth_yield,\n        aob_decay_rate_per_hour: preset.aob_decay_rate_per_hour,\n\n        nob_vmax_mg_n_per_g_per_hour: preset.nob_vmax_mg_n_per_g_per_hour,\n        nob_k_nitrite_mg: preset.nob_k_nitrite_mg,\n        nob_k_do_mg: preset.nob_k_do_mg,\n        nob_growth_yield: preset.nob_growth_yield,\n        nob_decay_rate_per_hour: preset.nob_decay_rate_per_hour,\n\n        comammox_vmax_fraction: preset.comammox_vmax_fraction,\n        comammox_k_tan_mg: preset.comammox_k_tan_mg,\n        comammox_k_do_mg: preset.comammox_k_do_mg,\n        comammox_growth_yield: preset.comammox_growth_yield,\n        comammox_decay_rate_per_hour: preset.comammox_decay_rate_per_hour,\n\n        o2_per_mg_n_nitrified: preset.o2_per_mg_n_nitrified,\n        alkalinity_meq_per_mg_n_nitrified: preset.alkalinity_meq_per_mg_n_nitrified,\n\n        plant_max_growth_rate_fast_stem_per_day: preset.plant_max_growth_rate_fast_stem_per_day,\n        plant_max_growth_rate_root_rosette_per_day: preset\n            .plant_max_growth_rate_root_rosette_per_day,\n        plant_respiration_fraction_per_day: preset.plant_respiration_fraction_per_day,\n        plant_senescence_fraction_per_day: preset.plant_senescence_fraction_per_day,\n        plant_health_recovery_per_day: preset.plant_health_recovery_per_day,\n        plant_health_decline_per_day: preset.plant_health_decline_per_day,\n        plant_half_saturation_n_mg_total: preset.plant_half_saturation_n_mg_total,\n        plant_half_saturation_p_mg_total: preset.plant_half_saturation_p_mg_total,\n        plant_half_saturation_c_mg_total: preset.plant_half_saturation_c_mg_total,\n        plant_light_half_saturation: preset.plant_light_half_saturation,\n        plant_temp_optimum_c: preset.plant_temp_optimum_c,\n        plant_temp_sigma_c: preset.plant_temp_sigma_c,\n        plant_crowding_biomass_g_per_m2: preset.plant_crowding_biomass_g_per_m2,\n\n        algae_max_growth_rate_per_day: preset.algae_max_growth_rate_per_day,\n        periphyton_max_growth_rate_per_day: preset.periphyton_max_growth_rate_per_day,\n        algae_respiration_fraction_per_day: preset.algae_respiration_fraction_per_day,\n        algae_half_saturation_n_mg_total: preset.algae_half_saturation_n_mg_total,\n        algae_half_saturation_p_mg_total: preset.algae_half_saturation_p_mg_total,\n        algae_light_half_saturation: preset.algae_light_half_saturation,\n        algae_temp_optimum_c: preset.algae_temp_optimum_c,\n        algae_temp_sigma_c: preset.algae_temp_sigma_c,\n        periphyton_capacity_g_per_m2: preset.periphyton_capacity_g_per_m2,\n        algae_bloom_threshold_g_per_l: preset.algae_bloom_threshold_g_per_l,\n        algae_nuisance_biomass_g_per_m2: preset.algae_nuisance_biomass_g_per_m2,\n\n        shrimp_base_mortality_per_day: preset.shrimp_base_mortality_per_day,\n        shrimp_stress_mortality_scale: preset.shrimp_stress_mortality_scale,\n        shrimp_juvenile_maturation_days: preset.shrimp_juvenile_maturation_days,\n        shrimp_periphyton_grazing_g_per_shrimp_per_day: preset\n            .shrimp_periphyton_grazing_g_per_shrimp_per_day,\n        shrimp_condition_smoothing: preset.shrimp_condition_smoothing,\n\n        microfauna_mineralization_boost: preset.microfauna_mineralization_boost,\n        microfauna_periphyton_consumption: preset.microfauna_periphyton_consumption,\n        microfauna_population_smoothing: preset.microfauna_population_smoothing,\n        microfauna_shrimp_pressure_threshold: preset.microfauna_shrimp_pressure_threshold,\n    }\n}\n\n/// Materializes a scenario preset into a fully resolved `TankState`.\n///\n/// - Geometry comes from the scenario.\n/// - `environment.ambient_temp_c` comes from the scenario.\n/// - Initial `WaterState` totals come from the source-water profile × fill volume.\n/// - Substrate layers come from the scenario's substrate preset IDs.\n/// - Plant guilds come from the scenario's plant preset IDs.\n/// - Source-water catalog is populated with all known source-water presets.\n/// - Process parameters come from the scenario's process params preset.\npub fn seeded_state(seed: SimSeed, scenario_id: &str) -> Result<TankState, tank_data::PresetError> {\n    let scenario = load_named_scenario(scenario_id)?;\n    materialize_scenario(seed, scenario)\n}\n\nfn materialize_scenario(\n    seed: SimSeed,\n    scenario: ScenarioPreset,\n) -> Result<TankState, tank_data::PresetError> {\n    // Geometry\n    let geometry = TankGeometry {\n        length_cm: scenario.tank_length_cm,\n        width_cm: scenario.tank_width_cm,\n        height_cm: scenario.tank_height_cm,\n        fill_height_cm: scenario.fill_height_cm,\n        glass_thickness_mm: 5.0,\n        open_top: true,\n        lid_exchange_factor: 0.25,\n    };\n\n    // Source water profile for initial fill\n    let source_water_preset = tank_data::load_source_water(&scenario.source_water_id)?;\n    let source_profile = source_water_to_profile(&source_water_preset);\n\n    // Initial water state from source-water profile\n    let water = WaterState::from_source_profile(&source_profile, &geometry);\n\n    // Build source-water catalog with all known presets\n    let mut source_water_catalog = BTreeMap::new();\n    for sw_id in tank_data::source_water_ids() {\n        let sw_preset = tank_data::load_source_water(sw_id)?;\n        source_water_catalog.insert(sw_id.to_string(), source_water_to_profile(&sw_preset));\n    }\n\n    // Process parameters\n    let process_preset = tank_data::load_process_params(&scenario.process_params_id)?;\n    let process_params = process_preset_to_params(&process_preset);\n\n    // Substrate layers\n    let mut substrate_layers = Vec::new();\n    for sub_id in &scenario.substrate_ids {\n        let sub_preset = tank_data::load_substrate(sub_id)?;\n        let footprint = geometry.footprint_area_cm2();\n        substrate_layers.push(SubstrateLayerState {\n            kind: match sub_preset.id.as_str() {\n                \"inert_sand\" => tank_core::SubstrateKind::InertSand,\n                \"inert_gravel\" => tank_core::SubstrateKind::InertGravel,\n                \"active_planted\" => tank_core::SubstrateKind::ActivePlanted,\n                \"coarse_porous\" => tank_core::SubstrateKind::CoarsePorous,\n                other => {\n                    return Err(tank_data::PresetError::Validation {\n                        category: \"substrate\",\n                        id: other.to_string(),\n                        message: format!(\"unsupported substrate kind: `{other}`\"),\n                    });\n                }\n            },\n            depth_cm: sub_preset.depth_cm,\n            nutrient_store_mg_n_total: sub_preset.nutrient_charge_mg_n_total,\n            nutrient_store_mg_p_total: sub_preset.nutrient_charge_mg_p_total,\n            cation_exchange_capacity_index: sub_preset.cation_exchange_capacity_index,\n            detritus_trapping_index: sub_preset.detritus_trapping_index,\n            colonizable_area_cm2: footprint * sub_preset.colonizable_area_factor,\n            low_oxygen_tendency_index: sub_preset.low_oxygen_tendency_index,\n            grazing_surface_index: sub_preset.grazing_surface_index,\n        });\n    }\n    if substrate_layers.is_empty() {\n        substrate_layers.push(SubstrateLayerState::default());\n    }\n\n    // Plant guilds\n    let mut plant_guilds = Vec::new();\n    for plant_id in &scenario.plant_ids {\n        let plant_preset = tank_data::load_plant(plant_id)?;\n        let guild = match plant_preset.guild.as_str() {\n            \"FastStem\" => PlantGuild::FastStem,\n            \"RootFeedingRosette\" => PlantGuild::RootFeedingRosette,\n            other => {\n                return Err(tank_data::PresetError::Validation {\n                    category: \"plants\",\n                    id: plant_id.clone(),\n                    message: format!(\"unsupported plant guild: `{other}`\"),\n                });\n            }\n        };\n        plant_guilds.push(PlantGuildState {\n            guild,\n            biomass_g: 5.0,\n            health_index: 0.8,\n            crowding_index: 0.1,\n            habitat_index: if guild == PlantGuild::RootFeedingRosette {\n                // Habitat factor depends on substrate quality\n                substrate_layers\n                    .iter()\n                    .map(|l| l.cation_exchange_capacity_index)\n                    .fold(0.0_f64, f64::max)\n                    .max(0.3)\n            } else {\n                0.8\n            },\n        });\n    }\n    if plant_guilds.is_empty() {\n        plant_guilds.push(PlantGuildState::default());\n    }\n\n    // Shrimp species parameters\n    let shrimp_preset = tank_data::load_shrimp(&scenario.shrimp_profile_id)?;\n    let shrimp_params = ShrimpRuntimeParams {\n        optimal_temp_min_c: shrimp_preset.optimal_temp_min_c,\n        optimal_temp_max_c: shrimp_preset.optimal_temp_max_c,\n        gh_min_d: shrimp_preset.gh_min_d,\n        gh_max_d: shrimp_preset.gh_max_d,\n        base_spawn_rate: shrimp_preset.base_spawn_rate,\n        egg_duration_days: shrimp_preset.egg_duration_days,\n        hatch_success_base: shrimp_preset.hatch_success_base,\n        juvenile_sensitivity: shrimp_preset.juvenile_sensitivity,\n        high_temp_repro_penalty_start_c: shrimp_preset.high_temp_repro_penalty_start_c,\n        high_temp_repro_penalty_full_c: shrimp_preset.high_temp_repro_penalty_full_c,\n    };\n\n    // Environment\n    let environment = tank_core::EnvironmentState {\n        ambient_temp_c: scenario.ambient_temp_c,\n        ..Default::default()\n    };\n\n    let mut state = TankState::new(seed);\n    state.meta = SimMeta {\n        scenario_id: Some(scenario.id),\n        notes: Some(scenario.name),\n    };\n    state.geometry = geometry;\n    state.environment = environment;\n    state.water = water;\n    state.substrate_layers = substrate_layers;\n    state.plant_guilds = plant_guilds;\n    state.source_water_catalog = source_water_catalog;\n    state.process_params = process_params;\n    state.shrimp_params = shrimp_params;\n\n    Ok(state)\n}\n\nfn validate_geometry_overrides(\n    scenario_id: &str,\n    overrides: ScenarioGeometryOverrides,\n) -> Result<(), tank_data::PresetError> {\n    if !overrides.size_scale.is_finite() || overrides.size_scale <= 0.0 {\n        return Err(tank_data::PresetError::Validation {\n            category: \"scenarios\",\n            id: scenario_id.to_string(),\n            message: format!(\n                \"size_scale must be finite and > 0.0, got {}\",\n                overrides.size_scale\n            ),\n        });\n    }\n\n    if !overrides.fill_ratio.is_finite() || !(0.1..=1.0).contains(&overrides.fill_ratio) {\n        return Err(tank_data::PresetError::Validation {\n            category: \"scenarios\",\n            id: scenario_id.to_string(),\n            message: format!(\n                \"fill_ratio must be finite and in 0.1..=1.0, got {}\",\n                overrides.fill_ratio\n            ),\n        });\n    }\n\n    Ok(())\n}\n\n/// Creates a deterministic cycling fixture pair: one seeded, one unseeded.\n/// Both tanks are otherwise identical (~20L nano tank with moderate source water,\n/// fed daily, with aeration enabled).\n/// The seeded tank starts with elevated nitrifier biomass and higher maturity;\n/// the unseeded tank starts with minimal microbes and low maturity.\npub fn cycling_fixture_pair(seed: SimSeed) -> (TankState, TankState) {\n    let base = cycling_base_state(seed);\n\n    let mut seeded = base.clone();\n    seeded.meta.scenario_id = Some(\"cycling_seeded\".to_string());\n    // Seeded: same decomposer biomass but much higher nitrifier biomass + maturity\n    seeded.microbe = MicrobeState {\n        decomposer_biomass_g: 0.1,\n        ammonia_oxidizer_biomass_g: 0.20,\n        nitrite_oxidizer_biomass_g: 0.15,\n        comammox_biomass_g: 0.05,\n        maturity_index: 0.6,\n    };\n    seeded.filter_state = FilterState {\n        biofilter_maturity_index: 0.6,\n        clogging_index: 0.0,\n        seeded_biomass_index: 0.8,\n    };\n\n    let mut unseeded = base;\n    unseeded.meta.scenario_id = Some(\"cycling_unseeded\".to_string());\n    // Unseeded: same decomposer biomass but minimal nitrifier biomass + maturity\n    unseeded.microbe = MicrobeState {\n        decomposer_biomass_g: 0.1,\n        ammonia_oxidizer_biomass_g: 0.005,\n        nitrite_oxidizer_biomass_g: 0.005,\n        comammox_biomass_g: 0.001,\n        maturity_index: 0.05,\n    };\n    unseeded.filter_state = FilterState {\n        biofilter_maturity_index: 0.05,\n        clogging_index: 0.0,\n        seeded_biomass_index: 0.0,\n    };\n\n    (seeded, unseeded)\n}\n\n/// Base state shared by both cycling fixtures.\nfn cycling_base_state(seed: SimSeed) -> TankState {\n    let geometry = TankGeometry {\n        length_cm: 30.0,\n        width_cm: 25.0,\n        height_cm: 30.0,\n        fill_height_cm: 26.0,\n        glass_thickness_mm: 5.0,\n        open_top: true,\n        lid_exchange_factor: 0.25,\n    };\n\n    let water = WaterState::default_for_geometry(&geometry);\n\n    let mut state = TankState::new(seed);\n    state.geometry = geometry;\n    state.water = water;\n    state.water.temperature_c = 25.0;\n    state.environment.ambient_temp_c = 25.0;\n\n    // Enable moderate aeration\n    state.hardware.aeration.enabled = true;\n    state.hardware.aeration.intensity = 0.3;\n\n    // Single fast-stem plant\n    state.plant_guilds = vec![PlantGuildState {\n        guild: PlantGuild::FastStem,\n        biomass_g: 3.0,\n        health_index: 0.8,\n        crowding_index: 0.1,\n        habitat_index: 0.8,\n    }];\n\n    state.process_params = ProcessParams::default();\n\n    state\n}\n","numLines":421,"startLine":1,"totalLines":421}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011PYLYu2TruP7DdYkZCU2qb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture of the gap. The prompt requires:\n\n> The MVP must allow a user to:\n> - choose a tank size and fill height ✅ (done)\n> - choose substrate, source water, plants, filter, light, heater, and shrimp count ❌ (bundled into scenarios)\n\nThe current startup screen only has: Scenario, Tank Size, Fill Height, Launch.\n\nThe next feature needs to add independent selection for:\n1. Source water profile (4 options: soft_acidic, moderate, hard_shrimp, ro_like)\n2. Substrate layers (4 options, 1-3 layers)\n\n\n3. Plant selection (2 guilds: fast_stem, root_rosette, both, or none)\n4. Filter (enabled/disabled, flow rate)\n5. Light (photoperiod, intensity)\n6. Heater (enabled/disabled, setpoint, wattage)\n7. Initial shrimp count\n\nThe ScenarioPreset model is missing filter, light, heater, and shrimp count fields, and the materialization function defaults everything for hardware. I need to extend the startup configuration with per-component selection fields, then either extend the scenario materialization or create a separate override path to apply these choices.\n\nSince the PlayerAction enum is fixed and doesn't include `ChangeHeaterEnabled`, I'll need to make heater on/off configurable at startup rather than as a runtime action. For the TUI, I'll keep scenarios as templates and add override fields for source water, substrate, plants, heater state and setpoint, light settings, filter and aeration state, and initial shrimp count—applying these overrides after materializing the scenario. The existing Left/Right navigation pattern can extend to handle these additional fields.\n\nFor substrate, since the prompt supports 1-3 layers, I'll offer preset layer combinations instead of individual layer selection to keep the interface manageable. Now I'll write out the full spec.","signature":""}]